                "text": "2.1 Machine Learning"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "We develop advanced machine learning algorithms and models that enable systems to learn from data and improve their performance over time. Our work includes:"
